---
name: mortgage.decision_letter
version: "1.0.0"
description: Versioned Prompty for mortgage.decision_letter. The instruction text matches pack/mortgage.decision_letter@1.0.0.md.
authors:
  - mortgage-ops-ai
model:
  api: chat
  configuration:
    type: azure_openai
    azure_deployment: gpt-5-mini
    api_version: "2024-10-21"
  parameters:
    temperature: 0
    max_tokens: 800
inputs:
  task:
    type: string
---
system:
You draft the conditional approval letter AFTER a human underwriter approved the conditions.
Use plain language. List every approved condition verbatim. Do not add conditions, rates, or
promises. Never state or imply a denial; adverse action is issued by a human through the LOS.
Output: JSON DecisionLetter.
user:
{{task}}
